  "sn17.6:0.2": "",
  "sn17.6:0.3": "6. Asanisuttaṃ ",
  "sn17.6:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati…pe… ",
  "sn17.6:1.2": "‘‘dāruṇo, bhikkhave, lābhasakkārasiloko…pe… adhigamāya. ",
  "sn17.6:1.3": "Kaṃ, bhikkhave, asanivicakkaṃ āgacchatu , sekhaṃ appattamānasaṃ lābhasakkārasiloko anupāpuṇātu’’ . ",
  "sn17.6:2.1": "‘‘Asanivicakkanti kho, bhikkhave, lābhasakkārasilokassetaṃ adhivacanaṃ. ",
  "sn17.6:2.2": "Evaṃ dāruṇo kho, bhikkhave, lābhasakkārasiloko…pe… ",
  "sn17.6:2.3": "evañhi vo, bhikkhave, sikkhitabba’’nti. ",
  "sn17.6:2.4": "Chaṭṭhaṃ. "
}
